<span id="Description"></span>
==Opis==

Narzędzie [[Image:Assembly_SelectJointsOfComponent.svg|24px]] [[Assembly_SelectJointsOfComponent/pl|Wybierz połączenia komponentu]] zaznacza połączenia związane z komponentem.

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
==Usage==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
# Make sure that an assembly is active.
# Select a single component.
# There are several ways to invoke the tool:
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Assembly → [[Image:Assembly_SelectJointsOfComponent.svg|16px]] Select Component Joints}} option from the menu.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Assembly → [[Image:Assembly_SelectJointsOfComponent.svg|16px]] Select Component Joints}} option from the [[Tree_View|Tree View]] or [[3D_View|3D View]] context menu.
# The component is deselected and its related joints are selected in the Tree View.
</div>


